  "screens": {
    "map": {
      "title": "Porchfest map",
      "body": {
        "type": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "caption",
            "value": "Cambridge Porchfest, July 11\u201312, 2026. Porches colored by time block \u2014 blue = 12\u20132 PM, green = 2\u20134 PM, amber = 4\u20136 PM. Tap or drag across the day/time strip and filter by genre in the control panel, or press \u25b6 to sweep the day one slot at a time \u2014 matching pins gently pulse. Tap a pin or list row to zoom in and see the performer's start time, genre and website."
          },
          {
            "type": "datacontrols",
            "table": "events",
            "dock": "auto",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "databars",
                "table": "events",
                "column": "slot",
                "sectionColumn": "day",
                "colors": {
                  "Sat 12 PM": "blue",
                  "Sat 1 PM": "blue",
                  "Sat 2 PM": "green",
                  "Sat 3 PM": "green",
                  "Sat 4 PM": "amber",
                  "Sat 5 PM": "amber",
                  "Sun 12 PM": "blue",
                  "Sun 1 PM": "blue",
                  "Sun 2 PM": "green",
                  "Sun 3 PM": "green",
                  "Sun 4 PM": "amber",
                  "Sun 5 PM": "amber"
                },
                "play": true
              },
              {
                "type": "datasegment",
                "table": "events",
                "column": "genreTag",
                "label": "Genre",
                "max": 12
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "column",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "pick",
                  "table": "viewPrefs",
                  "rowId": "v1",
                  "column": "view",
                  "variant": "segmented",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "value": "map",
                      "label": "Map"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": "table",
                      "label": "Table"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "switch",
                  "table": "viewPrefs",
                  "rowId": "v1",
                  "column": "view",
                  "cases": {
                    "map": {
                      "type": "column",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "map",
                          "table": "events",
                          "latColumn": "lat",
                          "lonColumn": "lon",
                          "labelColumn": "artist",
                          "colorColumn": "zone",
                          "colors": {
                            "12\u20132 PM": "blue",
                            "2\u20134 PM": "green",
                            "4\u20136 PM": "amber"
                          },
                          "configSource": "board",
                          "cluster": true,
                          "markerPulse": true,
                          "userLocation": true,
                          "zoom": 15,
                          "height": "520",
                          "action": {
                            "fn": "openLink"
                          },
                          "listSubtitleColumn": "start",
                          "listTagColumn": "genreTag",
                          "detailPopup": true,
                          "detailFields": [
                            "start",
                            "genreTag"
                          ],
                          "linkColumn": "url"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "row",
                          "wrap": true,
                          "spacing": 16,
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "type": "row",
                              "spacing": 4,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "\u25cf",
                                  "color": "blue"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "12\u20132 PM",
                                  "style": "caption"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "row",
                              "spacing": 4,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "\u25cf",
                                  "color": "green"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "2\u20134 PM",
                                  "style": "caption"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "row",
                              "spacing": 4,
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "\u25cf",
                                  "color": "amber"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "value": "4\u20136 PM",
                                  "style": "caption"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "table": {
                      "type": "cards",
                      "table": "events",
                      "title": "artist",
                      "subtitle": "address",
                      "groupBy": "slot",
                      "tags": [
                        {
                          "column": "start"
                        },
                        {
                          "column": "genreTag"
                        }
                      ],
                      "configSource": "board",
                      "search": true,
                      "typeToSearch": true,
                      "filterable": true,
                      "filterableColumns": [
                        "artist",
                        "day",
                        "start",
                        "hour",
                        "genreTag",
                        "address",
                        "slot"
                      ],
                      "collapsible": true,
                      "sortBy": "startMin",
                      "height": 520,
                      "action": {
                        "fn": "editRow"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "default": {
                    "type": "column",
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "type": "map",
                        "table": "events",
                        "latColumn": "lat",
                        "lonColumn": "lon",
                        "labelColumn": "artist",
                        "colorColumn": "zone",
                        "colors": {
                          "12\u20132 PM": "blue",
                          "2\u20134 PM": "green",
                          "4\u20136 PM": "amber"
                        },
                        "configSource": "board",
                        "cluster": true,
                        "markerPulse": true,
                        "userLocation": true,
                        "zoom": 15,
                        "height": "520",
                        "action": {
                          "fn": "openLink"
                        },
                        "listSubtitleColumn": "start",
                        "listTagColumn": "genreTag",
                        "detailPopup": true,
                        "detailFields": [
                          "start",
                          "genreTag"
                        ],
                        "linkColumn": "url"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "row",
                        "wrap": true,
                        "spacing": 16,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "row",
                            "spacing": 4,
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "\u25cf",
                                "color": "blue"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "12\u20132 PM",
                                "style": "caption"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "row",
                            "spacing": 4,
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "\u25cf",
                                "color": "green"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "2\u20134 PM",
                                "style": "caption"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "row",
                            "spacing": 4,
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "\u25cf",
                                "color": "amber"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "text",
                                "value": "4\u20136 PM",
                                "style": "caption"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "schedule": {
      "title": "Schedule",
      "body": {
        "type": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "cards",
            "table": "events",
            "title": "artist",
            "subtitle": "address",
            "groupBy": "hour",
            "tags": [
              {
                "column": "start"
              },
              {
                "column": "day"
              }
            ],
            "search": true,
            "typeToSearch": true,
            "filterable": true,
            "filterableColumns": [
              "artist",
              "day",
              "start",
              "hour",
              "genreTag",
              "address",
              "slot"
            ],
            "collapsible": true,
            "sortBy": "startMin",
            "height": 480,
            "action": {
              "fn": "editRow"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "about": {
      "title": "About this map",
      "body": {
        "type": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "title",
            "value": "Cambridgeport Porchfest"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "A two-day event. Saturday, July 11, 2026, 12:00 PM \u2013 6:00 PM, in the Cambridgeport neighborhood \u2014 a neighborhood-wide day of free porch concerts. Sunday, July 12, 2026, performances continue at restaurants and cafes along Mass Ave, in Central Square and Harvard Square, Cambridge MA."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "title",
            "value": "Where the data comes from"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Scraped today from cambridgeport.org/porchfestmaps and the City of Cambridge's public ArcGIS Porchfest dashboard feature layer, which carries exact GPS points for each performance on both days. Regenerate with apps/porchfest/pipeline/build.py."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "title",
            "value": "On accuracy"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Coordinates are the ArcGIS dashboard's own points, published by the organizers for this event \u2014 not independently geocoded, so a few porches may sit slightly off if the source point does. A handful of slots may be missing a pin if a row didn't carry a location."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "style": "title",
            "value": "Map color legend"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Blue = 12\u20132 PM \u00b7 green = 2\u20134 PM \u00b7 amber = 4\u20136 PM. Use the Map tab's control panel to filter by date (Saturday/Sunday), time block, or genre \u2014 the map, legend and pin colors all update together. Tap a pin or list row to zoom in on that performer and see a card with their start time, genre and an \"Open website\" button (when they listed one)."
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}